  "style_invariants": [
    "Illustrated 2.5D manhwa character matching the saved approved reference, not generic realistically shaded 3D.",
    "Authored skin shadows, directional linework, stylized eyes and detailed hair masses remain legible at studio and gameplay sizes.",
    "One recognizable adult identity per presentation across all seven presets; facial fullness may follow the preset.",
    "Warm medium skin, black hair, charcoal/black clothing, cyan accents and silver hardware for this comparison.",
    "Lighting, line quality and material finish remain consistent across the batch.",
    "Full hairstyle and feet are visible; studio ground baseline and nominal height are held constant without automatic per-body scaling.",
    "A coherent full-body master precedes any part extraction; independent generation of production limbs is prohibited.",
    "SoloGym project-specific art direction: female presets use smaller muscle volume than their corresponding male presets, with proportionate arms and legs and restrained definition; this is not a universal claim about anatomy or biology.",
    "The female fat_muscular preset retains a substantial soft belly, full waist and softer legs with moderate strength cues. Do not distinguish it by amplifying shoulder, upper-arm or leg bulk into bodybuilding proportions.",
    "Production equipment requires an authored fit for every supported body/view combination, sharing the body registration, pose and frame coordinates. Static approval boards are not rig assets or interchangeable equipment layers."
  ],
